      "changelog": "xiaozhi-teach-chinese-writing-guide 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release of a comprehensive Chinese writing instruction guide for language teachers.\n- Provides systematic workflows for writing assignment design, process guidance, three-dimensional grading (structure/language/thought), style DNA tracking, and review session design.\n- Enforces clear boundaries: does not generate or grade essays on behalf of students, only supplies frameworks and standards.\n- Integrates real-life scenarios into tasks and encourages the development of each student's unique writing style.\n- Designed to interface with lesson planning, student analysis, and in-class coaching tools.",
